      "text": "Reaper (systemd timer on the control VM)\n• deletes burner-scan VMs claimed > 20 min ago\n• deletes pool VMs stuck in arming > 15 min\n• a VM that's already gone is not an error",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Reaper (systemd timer on the control VM)\n• deletes burner-scan VMs claimed > 20 min ago\n• deletes pool VMs stuck in arming > 15 min\n• a VM that's already gone is not an error",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
